  },
  "f2": {
   "text": "pp 5.15~11.85 'everyone's wondering whether it works, whether it keeps the bugs away. Said I didn't know, I said I'd try it.' · 5~19초 낚시하는 화면",
   "kind": "본인 말+화면"
  },
  "f3": {
   "text": "pp 15.38~20.1 'People in the comments from the last video, many of them swore by it.' · 20.1~30.38 'Dragonflies are carnivorous insects… Dragonflies eat mosquitoes, flies, gnats…' + 종이(Dragon Flies — Mosquitoes, one of their favorite)",
   "kind": "본인 말+화면"
  },
  "f4": {
   "text": "mt 0~8초 'I'm going to test to see if this works for mosquitoes, since the mosquitoes were everywhere' · 화면 글자 'testing if a fake dragonfly stops mosquitoes' · 숲길·풀밭을 걷는 화면",
   "kind": "본인 말+화면"
  },
  "f5": {
   "text": "pp 36.7~42.5 'Look at my son wearing one. He's the one that told me about them in the first place.'",
   "kind": "본인 말"
  },
  "f6": {
   "text": "pp 42.5~44.29 'Last year, they were all the rage. TikTok sold out.'",
   "kind": "본인 말"
  }
 },
